        "kind": "none",
        "shows": null
      },
      "teaches": []
    },
    {
      "slide": 3,
      "does": "Teach and check the properties of the three stores",
      "look_at": {
        "kind": "diagram",
        "shows": "A table comparing coding, capacity and duration"
      },
      "teaches": [1]
    },
    {
      "slide": 4,
      "does": "Predict what happens to unattended information",
      "look_at": {
        "kind": "picture",
        "shows": "A student attending to one source among competing inputs"
      },
      "teaches": [2]
    },
    {
      "slide": 5,
      "does": "Explain transfers and forgetting in the model",
      "look_at": {
        "kind": "diagram",
        "shows": "The three stores linked by attention, rehearsal and retrieval"
      },
      "teaches": [2]
    },
    {
      "slide": 6,
      "does": "Model applying the stores and transfer processes",
      "look_at": {
        "kind": "diagram",
        "shows": "A worked route from hearing a code to recalling it later"
      },
      "teaches": [1, 2]
    },
    {
      "slide": 7,
      "does": "Apply the same model to a new code",
